title: "Neuron-Level Interpretability and Robustness in LLMs (SYNAPSE)"
abstract: >-
  Auditing framework for neuron-level interpretability and robustness of
  Transformer-based classifiers: probe-based neuron ranking, global and
  per-class silencing, random-neuron controls, attribution-method agreement,
  attribution-guided bit-flip, and output/weight-space perturbations.
